# Per-task herdr verification contracts are local task residue, not shared
# config. mech-contract writes claude/contracts/<task_id>-contract.json into
# each worker's worktree and verify-contract reads it from that worktree's
# filesystem (herdr_orch_core.py); nothing reads the committed copies. Keeping
# them tracked only accumulated merged per-task files on main. The mechanism is
# unaffected by ignoring them.
contracts/
